<http://data.silknow.org/object/7e749e71-c041-3b35-a32c-90557d993514/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Turcoman, Salor bag face\nDESIGN: field: red ground with central band of three large hooked and stepped guls.  Within each there is a red ground containing a multi-coloured star within a hooked cruciform.  Similar upper and lower bands are partially evident.  In two bands off-set to the guls are groups of nine small rectangles stepped diagonally in threes.  They are outlined in dark blue and contain white stars.\nMain border: dark purple ground with a two-coloured flowerhead set in a small, white horned motif and four florets between each pair.\nInner and outer border: red ground with touching S-motifs: dark blue (inner) blue (outer).\nLower band: immediately above plain weave is a band of reciprocal arrowheads in dark blue/red.  The red ones contain a white dot; the dark blue ones contain a red dot.\nUpper band: 24 \"tree of life\" motifs: every 4th one is blue; the others are dark green or dark blue.  They bear either red or white blossoms."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7e749e71-c041-3b35-a32c-90557d993514> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/7e749e71-c041-3b35-a32c-90557d993514/domain/1>
